{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Hell: Get a glimpse of the future. </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937460/extras/5990342a0bc2da8a88359a8489cd767b.avif?t=1747502198\" width=612 height=180 /></span><br>Survival Hell world is ruled by some mysterious event, that got majority of the population infected. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937460/extras/405d543e32c1ceb6e674f5655bb5924c.avif?t=1747502198\" width=612 height=180 /></span><br>You must survive by finding food, shelter, watching out for wildlife, bandits, and infected people. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937460/extras/e57dbb19cd87f07e967aecdcca3f4ea3.avif?t=1747502198\" width=612 height=180 /></span><br>If you decide to do so, you can help other survivors. <br>Infected activity will be reduced during sunlight and increased during the night, however during heavy thunderstorms or dense mists they will hunt for meat.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937460/extras/5990342a0bc2da8a88359a8489cd767b.avif?t=1747502198\" width=612 height=180 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><br>Base Building with ability to build shelters, camps, fires, cooking and blacksmith forge.<br><br>Electrical devices and fuel mechanics <br><br>Resource gathering mechanics with ability harvest wood and rocks.<br><br>Animal harvesting mechanics<br><br>Dynamic weather with Day-Night cycle, seasons and weather events like heavy thunderstorms, dense fog and dust-storms.<br><br>Passing time and resting mechanics impacting your stamina and fatigue<br><br>Wounds, Illness, Poisoning and Cold mechanics<br><br>AI mechanics including wildlife, Infected and other survivors which can be hostile like Bandits or helpful like Allies.<br><br>Vehicles driving<br><br>Stealth attacks mechanics <br><br>Equipment system with clothing system included<br><br>Vast world to explore with various areas like camps, outposts and other POI.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROAD MAP</h2><br>Performance and optimization fixes<br>Fine tuning the game characteristics <br>Bug fixing<br>Main story development","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"fdcdad64fc3456082d2c54f28be6ff608cac95c8.jpg","localized_name":"BUILD A FORGE","name":"BUILD A FORGE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/fdcdad64fc3456082d2c54f28be6ff608cac95c8.jpg"},{"icon":"2a9fb741f45411cb971d0d340434eab6b3533f7e.jpg","localized_name":"BUILD A WORKSHOP","name":"BUILD A WORKSHOP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/2a9fb741f45411cb971d0d340434eab6b3533f7e.jpg"},{"icon":"2a5b595d0fc0e0c20b39f4e54ed4d17bb29a8799.jpg","localized_name":"GRAVEYARD","name":"GRAVEYARD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/2a5b595d0fc0e0c20b39f4e54ed4d17bb29a8799.jpg"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"CAMPFIRE","name":"CAMPFIRE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"COOKINGSTAND","name":"COOKINGSTAND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"STORAGEBOX","name":"STORAGEBOX","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"CRAFT A KNIFE","name":"CRAFT A KNIFE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"COOK A MEAT","name":"COOK A MEAT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/937460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"REST","name":"REST","pat